abstract: >-
  Preflop strategy for No-Limit Hold'em by game (players, stacks, rake): opens,
  3-bets, 4-bets and the responses to them, by hand class, rounded so that
  people can use them. First game: 6-max, 100bb, no rake.
keywords:
  - poker
  - no-limit hold'em
  - preflop
  - game theory
